{"seq":42,"slug":"engineering-hiring-team-building","title":"技术团队组建与招聘","stage":"DONE","category":"management","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-hiring-team-building","rating":{"composite":3.88,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 技术团队组建与招聘\n\n技术团队的组建是工程管理中杠杆率最高的活动。一个精心设计的招聘系统能在 6-12 个月内将团队从零带到高效产出，而一个混乱的流程则会让组织在人才争夺战中持续失血。2026 年的技术招聘市场已发生代际跃迁：AI 工具重新定义了「优秀工程师」的标准，角色专业化程度前所未有地细分，候选人对公司信息的掌握量远超以往。\n\n本 hub 聚焦于团队组建阶段的**系统设计**——将招聘视为一个可重复、可度量、可优化的工程系统。从招聘哲学的确立、角色定义与层级体系的搭建，到面试环节的结构化设计、团队组合的规划、入职融入的加速，再到长期留存的制度保障，形成完整的闭环。\n\n与相邻 hub 的分工边界：\n\n- **engineering-management**（工程管理）关注团队已就位后的日常运营——1:1、迭代节奏、绩效评估、冲突解决。本 hub 的输出是那个系统的输入。\n- **technical-interviewer**（技术面试官）深入面试官个人技巧——如何追问、如何评分、如何避免偏见。本 hub 从组织层面设计面试体系的架构，面试官 hub 则训练执行者。\n\n核心受众是正在或即将承担「从 0 到 1 建团队」或「从 1 到 N 扩团队」职责的工程管理者。内容按四个递进阶段编排：招聘策略（为什么招、招什么）→ 评估体系（怎么选）→ 团队构建（怎么融合与启动）→ 留存发展（怎么持续）。每个阶段都包含可直接落地的框架、度量指标和决策模型。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"strategy","title":"招聘策略","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-hiring-team-building/strategy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hiring-philosophy","title":"招聘哲学与组织对齐","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-hiring-team-building/strategy/hiring-philosophy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"role-definition-leveling","title":"角色定义与层级体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-hiring-team-building/strategy/role-definition-leveling"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sourcing-pipeline","title":"人才供给管道","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-hiring-team-building/strategy/sourcing-pipeline"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"assessment","title":"评估体系","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-hiring-team-building/assessment","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"technical-interview-design","title":"技术面试设计方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-hiring-team-building/assessment/technical-interview-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"system-design-interview","title":"系统设计面试评估框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-hiring-team-building/assessment/system-design-interview"},{"seq":3,"slug":"behavioral-culture-fit","title":"行为与文化匹配面试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-hiring-team-building/assessment/behavioral-culture-fit"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"team-building","title":"团队构建","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-hiring-team-building/team-building","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"team-composition","title":"团队组合设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-hiring-team-building/team-building/team-composition"},{"seq":2,"slug":"onboarding-ramp-up","title":"入职融入与加速","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-hiring-team-building/team-building/onboarding-ramp-up"},{"seq":3,"slug":"team-growth-scaling","title":"团队成长与扩展策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-hiring-team-building/team-building/team-growth-scaling"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"retention","title":"留存与发展","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-hiring-team-building/retention","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"career-ladder-development","title":"职业阶梯与发展路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-hiring-team-building/retention/career-ladder-development"},{"seq":2,"slug":"compensation-equity","title":"薪酬与股权设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-hiring-team-building/retention/compensation-equity"},{"seq":3,"slug":"engineering-culture","title":"工程文化建设","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-hiring-team-building/retention/engineering-culture"}]}]}